The rounding change is in `src/math.ts`:

- `subtract` now rounds to cents with `Math.round(x * 100) / 100`
- `add` is unchanged

```ts
export function subtract(a: number, b: number): number {
  return Math.round((a - b) * 100) / 100;
}
```

See the [rounding notes](https://example.com/rounding) for why cents.
